From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lucas gelfond <lucasgelfond@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 20:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 33/33] avcodec: audio: keep the front centre pair of 7.1 wide layouts

VLC has no front-left/right-of-centre channels, so the pair was dropped
from every layout that has it ("2 channels are dropped"). DTS-HD MA 7.1
is usually "7.1 (wide)": L R C LFE Ls Rs Lc Rc, with no side channels, and
lost two of its eight channels.

When a layout has the centre pair and no side channels, map the pair to
the middle left/right channels, the positions VLC's 7.1 uses.
---
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/modules/codec/avcodec/audio.c b/modules/codec/avcodec/audio.c
--- a/modules/codec/avcodec/audio.c
+++ b/modules/codec/avcodec/audio.c
@@ -687,11 +687,24 @@ static void SetupOutputFormat( decoder_t *p_dec, bool b_trust )
 
         assert(stdc_count_ones(channel_layout_mask) == (unsigned)channel_count);
 
+        /* VLC has no front left/right of centre. In a layout without side
+         * channels (7.1 "wide", DTS-HD MA), put them there rather than
+         * dropping two channels. */
+        const bool b_wide = (channel_layout_mask & (AV_CH_FRONT_LEFT_OF_CENTER |
+                                                    AV_CH_FRONT_RIGHT_OF_CENTER)) &&
+                           !(channel_layout_mask & (AV_CH_SIDE_LEFT | AV_CH_SIDE_RIGHT));
         for( unsigned i = 0; pi_channels_map[i][0]
          && i_channels_src < channel_count; i++ )
         {
             if( channel_layout_mask & pi_channels_map[i][0] )
-                pi_order_src[i_channels_src++] = pi_channels_map[i][1];
+            {
+                uint32_t chan = pi_channels_map[i][1];
+                if( b_wide && pi_channels_map[i][0] == AV_CH_FRONT_LEFT_OF_CENTER )
+                    chan = AOUT_CHAN_MIDDLELEFT;
+                else if( b_wide && pi_channels_map[i][0] == AV_CH_FRONT_RIGHT_OF_CENTER )
+                    chan = AOUT_CHAN_MIDDLERIGHT;
+                pi_order_src[i_channels_src++] = chan;
+            }
         }
 
         if( i_channels_src != channel_count && b_trust )
